    "link": "https://www.hellointerview.com/learn/low-level-design/in-a-hurry/patterns#decorator",
    "notes": "Textbook Decorator use case: wrap a base Beverage with add-on decorators instead of creating LargeMilkSugarCoffee-style subclass explosion. Machine dispense flow itself can reuse the Vending Machine's State pattern."
